### end token written in lower case
cat <<EOF
config follows
eof
>>> SC1009 1:1
>>- SC1043 1:7 -- an unterminated here-document is a parser syntax error whose message names the differently cased end line
>>> SC1072 4:1
>>> SC1073 1:5

### end token with mixed case
cat <<Banner
welcome
BANNER
>>> SC1009 1:1
>>- SC1043 1:7 -- an unterminated here-document is a parser syntax error whose message names the differently cased end line
>>> SC1072 4:1
>>> SC1073 1:5

### end token found as a substring instead
cat <<EOF
config follows
EOF.
>>> SC1009 1:1
>>- SC1041 1:7 -- an unterminated here-document is a parser syntax error whose message quotes the line holding the end token
>>- SC1042 1:7 -- an unterminated here-document is a parser syntax error whose message quotes the line holding the end token
>>> SC1072 4:1
>>> SC1073 1:5
>>+ SC2288 3:1 -- shellcheck aborts at the unterminated here-document; we recover by blanking that line and lint the remaining lines as commands

### no case-insensitive match
cat <<EOF
config follows
end
>>> SC1009 1:1
>>- SC1044 1:7 -- an unterminated here-document is a parser syntax error whose message says the end token is missing
>>> SC1072 4:1
>>> SC1073 1:5
